*** Keywords ***
TC 6062
    [Documentation]                 Generic test for CB006062_A_xxx (UL or UL_DL) tests
    [Arguments]                     ${param}
    Init Sequence                   ${param}
    Critical Step                   Set Context
    Critical Step                   Restart
    Step                            Captures Init
    Critical Step                   Test WTS Setup
    Critical Step                   Test Verify Cell Setup
    Step                            Captures Start
    Step                            SgNB Addition PRACH
    Step                            Captures Stop                                          depends=Captures Start
    #deletion of KW call due to X2AP problem decoding#Critical Step    Check Additional DMRS UL    depends=SgNB Addition PRACH
    #deletion of KW call due to X2AP problem decoding#Critical Step    Check PuschMappingType UL    depends=SgNB Addition PRACH
    Step                            Attach_FR1                                             depends=SgNB Addition PRACH
    Run Keyword If                  ${isAic}
    ...                                 Reduce_Pusch_RX_Power_AND_SINR
    ...         ELSE                    Run keyword if              '${GNB_DU.sys[0].M.boardType}'!='ASOE'
    ...                                     Run keyword if          '${GNB_DU.bb[0].M.boardType}'=='ABIP'
    ...                                                             Reduce_Pusch_RX_Power_AND_SINR_FOR_ABIP

    Step                            ${param.dir} Traffic
    Critical Step                   Check FDM UL
    Critical Step                   Check CRC OK for HarqU in UL
    Critical Step                   Check PTRS UL
    [Teardown]                      Display diagnosis

